#: Settings.ui:20 Settings.ui:25
msgid "Sensitivity"
msgstr "Comportement, Sensibilité"

#: Settings.ui:29
msgid "Show panel when mouse approaches edge of the screen"
msgstr ""
"Afficher la barre supérieure quand la souris approche le bord de l'écran"

#: Settings.ui:35
msgid "In the above case, also show panel when fullscreen"
msgstr ""
"Dans le cas ci-dessus, afficher également le panneau en cas de plein écran"

#: Settings.ui:41
msgid "Show panel in overview"
msgstr "Afficher le panneau dans la vue d'ensemble"

#: Settings.ui:47
msgid "Keep hot corner sensitive, even in hidden state"
msgstr "Conserver le coin actif, même si la barre supérieure est masquée"

#: Settings.ui:53
msgid "In the above case show overview, too"
msgstr ""
"Lancer la vue d'ensemble quand la souris approche de la barre supérieure"

#: Settings.ui:59
msgid "Keep round corners when top bar is hidden"
msgstr "Conserver les coins arrondis, même si la barre supérieure est masquée"

#: Settings.ui:65
msgid "Pressure barrier's threshold:"
msgstr "Seuil de pression (force nécessaire à la souris pour déclencher):"

#: Settings.ui:78
msgid "Pressure barrier's timeout:"
msgstr "Délai de pression:"

#: Settings.ui:93
msgid "Touch & Gestures"
msgstr ""

#: Settings.ui:97
msgid "Swipe down to reveal panel"
msgstr ""

#: Settings.ui:98
msgid ""
"Swipe down from top edge on touchscreens to temporarily reveal the panel"
msgstr ""

#: Settings.ui:104
msgid "Drag & Drop to top-left corner opens overview"
msgstr ""

#: Settings.ui:105
msgid ""
"Drag an item to the top-left corner to switch to overview during drag and "
"drop"
msgstr ""

#: Settings.ui:114 Settings.ui:119
msgid "Animation"
msgstr "Animation"

#: Settings.ui:123
msgid "Slide animation time when entering/leaving overview:"
msgstr "Durée d'animation en entrant ou sortant de l'apercu:"

#: Settings.ui:137
msgid "Slide animation time when mouse approaches edge of the screen:"
msgstr "Durée d'animation du masquage de la barre supérieure:"

#: Settings.ui:154 Settings.ui:159
msgid "Keyboard shortcuts"
msgstr "Raccourcis clavier"

#: Settings.ui:163
msgid ""
"Key that triggers the bar to be shown (press backspace to deactivate the "
"shortcut):"
msgstr "Touche déclenchant l'affichage de la barre supérieure"

#: Settings.ui:203
msgid ""
"Delay before the bar rehides after key press (a value of 0 disables the "
"rehiding):"
msgstr ""
"Délai avant remasquage de la barre supérieure après appui sur la touche"

#: Settings.ui:217
msgid "Pressing the shortcut again rehides the panel"
msgstr "Appuyer à nouveau sur la touche remasque la barre supérieure."

#: Settings.ui:226 Settings.ui:231
msgid "Intellihide"
msgstr "Masquage intelligent"

#: Settings.ui:235
msgid "Only hide panel when a window takes the space"
msgstr "Masque uniquement quand une fenêtre couvre sa place"

#: Settings.ui:241
msgid "Only when the active window takes the space"
msgstr "Masque uniquement quand la fenêtre active couvre la barre supérieure"
